fter the rollback, the service was healthy and the error rate was down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** I opened **INC-0001** (SEV2) for `payments-api`, saying v5.1.0 caused the errors and that we rolled back to v5.0.0. This paged the on-call engineer. There were no other open incidents for this.\n\nv5.1.0 should stay off production until someone finds the cause of the errors.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Uyw7wd4FZkSoQwNg7rEnQm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.85}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Nvi3QpWEwpVMvCB1SJSHMH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.85}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01EdcVTYrpZQ1WE2VbEJYJ8R", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_012vGs5pqHRRTgcAkfArDkcF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01W8XhLccMy3yADxKys8yjwK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_015X7CrEP2WZH2tLiujjq4CW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payment-service", "confidence": 0.5}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01PdnBP3B7MJf7TbD4TZteBv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_